---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Tria Uma"
  description="Learn how Tria Uma protects your personal information and respects your privacy."
>
  <section class="bg-forest text-white pt-36 pb-16 border-b border-white/10">
    <div class="container-editorial">
      <span class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-gold font-medium block mb-2">
        LEGAL & TRUST
      </span>
      <h1 class="editorial-title text-4xl sm:text-6xl max-w-2xl">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-white/70 max-w-xl text-xs sm:text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">
        We respect your discretion and handle your personal travel information with the highest degree of confidentiality and care.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-editorial py-16 md:py-24 max-w-3xl">
    <div class="space-y-8 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-forest mb-2">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          When you request a bespoke itinerary proposal or contact our reservation team, we may collect your name, email address, telephone/WhatsApp contact, travel dates, passenger details, and special dietary or room preferences.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-forest mb-2">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>
          Your details are strictly used to design personalized itineraries, confirm accommodation and chauffeur arrangements, process your travel reservations, and communicate official quotations. We never sell or share your personal data with third-party advertisers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-forest mb-2">3. Local Browser Storage</h2>
        <p>
          Our custom itinerary builder stores your draft itineraries, preferences, and guest profiles within your local browser's storage (<code class="bg-sand/40 px-1 py-0.5 text-forest font-mono">localStorage</code>). This ensures you can resume, edit, or print your travel proposals without requiring an external third-party tracking account.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-forest mb-2">4. Contact & Inquiries</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions regarding your personal information, please contact our privacy compliance team at <a href="mailto:reservation@triauma.com" class="text-forest underline">reservation@triauma.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

